{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122152","id":4216831532,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc77V74s","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122152","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122152.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122152.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122152","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122152/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122152/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122152/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/cb82343675bff34ec4729d264edb709876c9b0d1","number":122152,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Project Manager: Add Compact Mode Setting","user":{"login":"unit-tick","id":267148939,"node_id":"U_kgDOD-xeiw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/267148939?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick","html_url":"https://github.com/unit-tick","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes: #122092 \r\nFixes: #122257\r\n\r\nThe bug in that issue was caused by #121387 as it introduced a compact mode which hid the sidebar when the project manager was shrunk beyond a threshold. This PR does two things:\r\n\r\n- Adds Compact Mode setting: `project_manager/compact_mode`.\r\n- Adds Compact Mode Threshold setting: `project_manager/compact_mode_threshold` which set the point to hide the project manager sidebar.\r\n\r\nMy reasoning\r\n- Since the mentioned PR was andriod focused, a compact mode setting builds upon the PR, it is set to `on` by default on the intended mobile devices and `off` on desktop devices.\r\n- Because desktop devices have more real-estate, the `compact_mode_threshold` gives users more fine grained control. \r\n\r\nProject Titles also wrap properly, using the extra space given by the collapsed sidebar and dynamically resizes when the setting is turned on or off at any size.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b36e6be2-40e2-4105-917e-25de57b7407c","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/u